">Semi-Transparent</option><option id=\"captions-window-opacity-vjs_video_1903_component_2467-Opaque\" value=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-window-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 captions-window-opacity-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 captions-window-opacity-vjs_video_1903_component_2467-Opaque\">Opaque</option></select></span></fieldset></div><div class=\"vjs-track-settings-font\"><fieldset class=\"vjs-font-percent vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\">Font Size</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2544\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2545-50\" value=\"0.50\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2545-50\">50%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2546-75\" value=\"0.75\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2546-75\">75%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2547-100\" value=\"1.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2547-100\">100%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2548-125\" value=\"1.25\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2548-125\">125%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2549-150\" value=\"1.50\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2549-150\">150%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2550-175\" value=\"1.75\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2550-175\">175%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2551-200\" value=\"2.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2551-200\">200%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2552-300\" value=\"3.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2552-300\">300%</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2553-400\" value=\"4.00\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-size-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2553-400\">400%</option></select></fieldset><fieldset class=\"vjs-edge-style vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\">Text Edge Style</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2563\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2564-None\" value=\"none\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2564-None\">None</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2565-Raised\" value=\"raised\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2565-Raised\">Raised</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2566-Depressed\" value=\"depressed\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2566-Depressed\">Depressed</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2567-Uniform\" value=\"uniform\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2567-Uniform\">Uniform</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2568-Dropshadow\" value=\"dropshadow\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-edge-style-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2568-Dropshadow\">Drop shadow</option></select></fieldset><fieldset class=\"vjs-font-family vjs-track-setting\"><legend id=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\">Font Family</legend><select id=\"vjs_select_2578\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467\"><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2579-ProportionalSansSerif\" value=\"proportionalSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2579-ProportionalSansSerif\">Proportional Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2580-MonospaceSansSerif\" value=\"monospaceSansSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2580-MonospaceSansSerif\">Monospace Sans-Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2581-ProportionalSerif\" value=\"proportionalSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2581-ProportionalSerif\">Proportional Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2582-MonospaceSerif\" value=\"monospaceSerif\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2582-MonospaceSerif\">Monospace Serif</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2583-Casual\" value=\"casual\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2583-Casual\">Casual</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2584-Script\" value=\"script\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2584-Script\">Script</option><option id=\"vjs-track-option-2585-SmallCaps\" value=\"small-caps\" aria-labelledby=\"captions-font-family-vjs_video_1903_component_2467 vjs-track-option-2585-SmallCaps\">Small Caps</option></select></fieldset></div><div class=\"vjs-track-settings-controls\"><button class=\"vjs-default-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"restore all settings to the default values\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Reset</button><button class=\"vjs-done-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Done\" aria-disabled=\"false\">Done</button></div></div><button class=\"vjs-close-button vjs-control vjs-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Close Modal Dialog\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"vjs-icon-placeholder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"vjs-control-text\" aria-live=\"polite\">Close Modal Dialog</span></button><p class=\"vjs-control-text\">End of dialog window.</p></div></video-js></div></div></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">使用方法</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">打开聊天</h3>\n<div>快捷键: <code>⌘ + L</code>\n位置: Cursor右上角</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">上下文功能</h3>\n<h4><strong>默认上下文</strong>：</h4>\n<div>自动包含当前文件，可以在设置中关闭默认上下文</div>\n<h4><strong>添加自定义上下文</strong></h4>\n<div><strong>@Files</strong>: 引用整个文件(也可以直接拖动文件到聊天框)</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/q7fgaoum3f_img1.webp\" alt=\"@Files\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><strong>@Code</strong>: 引用特定代码段（可以直接复制代码段到聊天框）</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/q7fgaoum3f_img2.webp\" alt=\"@Code\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><strong>@Codebase</strong>: 搜索整个代码库(快捷键Cmd+Enter)</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/q7fgaoum3f_img3.webp\" alt=\"@Codebase\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><strong>@Docs</strong>: 引用文档</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/q7fgaoum3f_img4.webp\" alt=\"@Docs\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><strong>@Web</strong>: 搜索网络</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">Add new doc</h2>\n<div>在Cursor的设置中，点击Features，然后点击Add new doc，然后输入文档链接，就可以添加一个新的文档，Cursor会自动爬取文档内容。</div>\n<div>例如：我们添加 tailwindcss V3版本的文档\n<a href=\"https://v3.tailwindcss.com/docs/installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://v3.tailwindcss.com/docs/installation</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/q7fgaoum3f_img5.webp\" alt=\"tailwindcss docs\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>另外Cursor自带了很多Official Docs，例如：OpenAI的API Docs等等，可以直接在聊天框中输入：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Docs</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">OpenAI</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">API</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Docs</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">代码应用</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>通过点击代码块右上角的播放按钮应用代码</li>\n<li>快捷键:\n<ul>\n<li>接受: <code>Ctrl/⌘ Enter</code></li>\n<li>拒绝: <code>Ctrl/⌘ Backspace</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">AI 模型选择</h2>\n<div>Claude 3.5 Sonnet\nClaude 3.7 Sonnet</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">高级功能</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div><strong>长上下文聊天(Beta)</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>在 <code>Cursor Settings &gt; Beta &gt; Long Context Chat</code> 中启用</li>\n<li>使用 <code>Ctrl/⌘ .</code> 切换不同聊天模式</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><strong>聊天历史</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>查看: <code>Ctrl/⌘ + Alt/Option + L</code></li>\n<li>可以编辑标题和删除历史记录</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>",
